    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Gary O'Driscoll & Co. Ltd are delighted to bring to the market 27 Lisbeg, a three-bedroom detached bungalow situated in the ever sought-after Oakpark area of Tralee. Ideally positioned within a quiet cul-de-sac in a settled and mature residential development, this property offers an excellent opportunity for those seeking a home with significant potential to upgrade and personalise to their own requirements.\n\nThe property has been unoccupied for approximately six years and will qualify for the Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant, making this an appealing proposition for purchasers looking to undertake a comprehensive renovation project.\n\nThe accommodation briefly comprises an entrance hallway, sitting room, three bedrooms, family room, kitchen/dining room, utility room and guest toilet. Internally, the property is in need of upgrading throughout, including the electrical and heating systems, but offers excellent potential to create a comfortable and modern home.\n\nAccommodation:\n\nEntrance Hallway: 3.64m x 2.40m\nSitting Room: 5.22m x 3.50m\nBedroom 1: 4.60m x 3.20m\nBedroom 2: 3.03m x 3.36m\nBedroom 3: 3.37m x 2.45m\nFamily Room: 5.21m x 3.46m\nKitchen/Dining Room: 3.36m x 7.15m\nUtility Room & Guest Toilet: 2.47m x 2.76m\n\nThe property benefits from cavity wall construction, with the cavities having been pumped, providing a strong foundation for further refurbishment works.\n\nExternally, the property is further enhanced by a large, mature rear garden, offering excellent potential for landscaping, outdoor entertaining or simply enjoying a generous private garden space.\n\nThe location is a major feature of this property, being within easy walking distance of Tralee Town Centre and all the amenities it has to offer. Munster Technological University Kerry campus is also just a stone's throw away, making this an ideal location for families, first-time buyers, investors or those looking for a refurbishment project in a highly desirable residential area.\n\nWith its detached bungalow layout, generous accommodation, large mature rear garden and eligibility for the Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant, 27 Lisbeg represents an exciting opportunity to acquire a property with considerable scope for transformation in one of Tralee's most established and sought-after locations."
      },
